OL,3,GNEWSA'Unclaimed' #40.7m in little-known
OL,4,Apensioner benefit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn estimated #40.7m in a little-known
OL,7,Fbenefit for pensioners is going
OL,8,Funclaimed in Gloucestershire, according
OL,9,Fto research from the charity Age UK.
OL,11,FPensioners said there should be more
OL,12,Fawareness of the benefits available to
OL,13,Folder people with one - 73-year-old
OL,14,FMary Rose, from Cheltenham - saying she
OL,15,Fonly found out about Attendance
OL,16,FAllowance through her daughter who
OL,17,Fapplied on her behalf.
OL,19,F"Nobody ever tells you what you're
OL,20,Fentitled to," she said. "I think there
OL,21,Fshould be more advertising, especially
OL,22,Ffor older people."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
