OL,3,GNEWSA'Unclaimed' #40.7m in little-known
OL,4,Apensioner benefit
OL,5,
OL,6,FTracy Harris, marketing manager at Age
OL,7,FUK Gloucestershire, said: "There are a
OL,8,Flot of people who don't realise that it
OL,9,F[Attendance Allowance] is available to
OL,10,Fthem."
